s to your data\r\n-   Correction or deletion\r\n-   A copy of your data\r\n\r\nRequest via email: f.sh.ss89@gmail.com\r\n\r\n6.  Children’s Privacy Tutor is not intended for children under 13. If\r\n    you believe a child is using the app, contact us to delete the\r\n    account.\r\n\r\n7.  Data Retention\r\n\r\n-   Account information is kept until you delete your account.\r\n-   Chat data is stored as long as your account exists.\r\n-   Subscription records are retained as required.\r\n\r\n8.  Changes to This Privacy Policy We may update this Privacy Policy\r\n    from time to time and update the “Last updated” date. Significant\r\n    changes may be announced via email or in-app notification.\r\n\r\n9.  Contact Us Email: f.sh.ss89@gmail.com Developer: Farshad Shahsavari\r\n\r\n10. Acceptance of Changes By continuing to use the Tutor app after any\r\n    updated version of this Privacy Policy becomes effective, you agree\r\n    to the revised terms. If you do not agree with the updated Privacy\r\n    Policy, you must stop using Tutor and delete your account and the\r\n    app from your device.\r\n";
